{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51973","headline":"西江月（六首。以下词）（原八首，前二首已见《全唐诗》，此六首，《全宋词》亦未收。） 四 · 吕岩","name":"西江月（六首。以下词）（原八首，前二首已见《全唐诗》，此六首，《全宋词》亦未收。） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真假两般元字，金公所料重迷。\n凡铅纵与岳山齐，不肯假与金妻。\n听说真铅住处，他家跳在深溪。\n两情恩爱事因媒，义重争向东西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}